# Copy to `.env.local` and edit. Vite loads .env* automatically, and .env files
# are gitignored (except this example) so local values never get committed.
#
# Only VITE_-prefixed variables reach the browser bundle -- and everything that
# does is public, because it is compiled into JavaScript that anyone can read.
# Never put a secret here.

# Base URL of the PulseDB query API (the server's `query_port`, default 8081).
# Defaults to http://localhost:8081 when unset; override to point the dashboard
# at a remote or containerised collector.
VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8081
